    "The server stores no explain for ES docs (extract_docs_from_response_body_for_es never reads _explanation); the browser builds hot matches from it.",
    "Next page (from/size) and 'Show only rated' (bool.filter terms on _id) exist only in the browser.",
    "The browser asks for _id inside _source, because field_spec maps id to _id."
